@startuml M1-D2d-evidence-anchoring-flow
title Evidence Anchoring Flow - Sequence Diagram

actor Developer
participant "Web Application UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Hashing and Commitment Service" as Hash
participant "Cardano Network" as Cardano

Developer -> UI : upload evidence
UI -> API : submit evidence
API -> Hash : compute SHA-256
Hash -> Cardano : anchor hash
Cardano --> Hash : TXID
Hash --> API : hash + TXID
API --> UI : record reference

@enduml
